description:
Position Summary

We are seeking the Business Development Manager to drive market expansion in Saudi Arabia. The role requires proactive business development with government entities, design firms, contractors, and end-users, positioning our brand and products across the country.

Key Responsibilities

1.Develop and execute business development strategies targeting key government institutions and private sector clients;

2.Build and maintain relationships with architects, interior designers, contractors, fit-out companies, and end-users to drive brand specification at the project design stage;

3.Identify and pursue business opportunities from government and design channels, converting leads into sales;

4.Travel across Saudi Arabia as needed to meet clients at project sites and build local networks;

5.Coordinate client meetings and presentations for the reporting manager to ensure high-level engagement runs smoothly;

6.Represent the company professionally and uphold brand reputation.

Qualifications

1.Based in Riyadh, KSA, with ability to travel domestically as required;

2.Bachelor's degree or above;

3.Fluent in both English and Arabic;

4.Valid Saudi driving license;

5.3–5 years of experience in business development, government project sales, or client-facing roles;

6.Background in office furniture, fit-out, construction, architecture, design, or related material industries (e.g., wallpaper, carpet, stone) is preferred; cross-industry candidates must demonstrate strong sales capabilities and existing client networks;

7.Professional appearance with strong communication and presentation skills;Willing and able to engage in frequent client visits and front-line business development activities;
